<node id="1193699" title="Re^2: Escaping double quotes in complete document" created="2017-06-27 10:44:54" updated="2017-06-27 10:44:54" _doctext_mode="strict"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;This protects you from Cross-Site-Scripting attacks and handles the double quote issue.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not quite, you're missing the &lt;c&gt;html&lt;/c&gt; [mod://Template::Manual::Filters|filter], e.g.:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
use Template;
my $tt = Template-&gt;new();
my $soap = ' "foo" &lt;bar&gt; &amp;amp; ';
$tt-&gt;process(\&lt;&lt;END, {soap=&gt;$soap}) || die $tt-&gt;error();
&lt;html&gt;
  &lt;input type="text" name="mytext" value="[% soap %]"/&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
END
$tt-&gt;process(\&lt;&lt;END, {soap=&gt;$soap}) || die $tt-&gt;error();
&lt;html&gt;
  &lt;input type="text" name="mytext" value="[% soap | html %]"/&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
END

__END__

&lt;html&gt;
  &lt;input type="text" name="mytext" value=" "foo" &lt;bar&gt; &amp;amp; "/&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
  &lt;input type="text" name="mytext" value=" &amp;quot;foo&amp;quot; &amp;lt;bar&amp;gt; &amp;amp;amp; "/&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
&lt;/c&gt;</doctext>
